    <!--
      Each <item> is a release. Sparkle picks the highest sparkle:version
      that's compatible with the user's macOS, and verifies the EdDSA
      sparkle:edSignature against the public key embedded in the app's
      Info.plist (SUPublicEDKey). If our website is compromised, an
      attacker still can't push a malicious update without the private
      key (which lives in this Mac's Keychain).

      Don't edit by hand — `./scripts/release.sh <version>` prepends a
      fresh entry with the correct signature + size + timestamp.
    -->

