      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>v1.5.1 — Auto-update + bug fixes</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>🚀 <strong>Auto-update via Sparkle</strong> — NotchPop checks for updates every 4 hours, signs them with EdDSA, and posts a system notification when an update is found / installed.</li>
          <li>🎵 <strong>Music probe fix</strong> — added <code>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</code> so macOS Sequoia stops silently blocking AppleScript reads of Music/Spotify track info. Plus a 5-second re-probe covers songs that started after launch.</li>
          <li>📋 <strong>Clipboard widget</strong> · 🖥 <strong>System Stats widget</strong> · proper app icon · all carryover from v1.5.0.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
